{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55032","headline":"兵要望江南 禳厌第二十四（京本作「占厌禳第十九」○十三首） 十二 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 禳厌第二十四（京本作「占厌禳第十九」○十三首） 十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凡行阵，甲午甲寅（京本作「申」）旬。\n甲戌都来爲一处，当时（京本作「持」）刀剑在前行，其阵勒来兵。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55032.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55032","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}